<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld 5.701 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avge yld 5.701 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management's auction of a new series of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/2002</p>
<p>AMOUNT:21.42 billion esc	 COUPON:5.75</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD:5.701237</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED:5.74  LOWEST:5.59</p>
<p>BIDS: 96.12 billion esc PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual  </p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>NOTES - It is the first issue of the March 2002 paper. The auction takes to 28.56 billion the total amount of the bonds issued, including the quota reserved for marketmakers.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
